Ported files: src/mapping.rs, src/number.rs, src/scalar.rs (from de.rs),
src/value/*.rs, and tests/value.rs (from tests/test_value.rs). Each carries
an attribution header.

Changes from upstream: module paths; `use crate::de` in number.rs points at
src/scalar.rs; and elided lifetimes spelled out as `'_` in eight signatures
to satisfy current rustc lints (syntax only, no behavioural change); doc
examples call rivet_yaml:: instead of serde_yaml:: and import derives from
serde instead of serde_derive, so the doctests exercise this crate; clippy
allow attributes for lints newer than upstream; in tests/value.rs, indoc!
literals written out already dedented.
